      <activity id="ba348ac3-f30c-5382-9926-d7a8bad056d4" activityNameId="f32ea868-dfad-5fc9-a09a-973be72d86f4" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Pipeline, crude oil, onshore</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Pipeline, crude oil, onshore
Rough estimation based on use of materials and information for construction works by one company. Life time 30 years.;
UUID: 1c6d722e-821a-33ce-9708-8589e0903446
Materials, land use, energy use of construction company and dismantling of pipelines.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Construction of pipelines.
Time period: Data for materials published in 1980. Environmental data for construction of pipelines in 2000.
Production volume: There are 30780km of oil pipelines (on- and offshore) used in Europe.
Sampling: Literature and environmental report of a multinational company. 
Extrapolations: From single data to global situation.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_1c6d722e-821a-33ce-9708-8589e0903446.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
